# Analysis `/analysis`

- Operational analytics from real WorkItem and TimeEntry rows. Same filters, timezone, and formulas as Dashboard and lists.
- Default timezone for selected periods, date filters, time-series grouping, and persisted date/time values is `Asia/Bangkok`; do not convert timestamps to UTC.
- Filters: period, Project, functional role, kind. Show the active filters on the page.
- Show status/kind/priority breakdowns, completed, open/overdue, and hours. Trends use day/week/month of the selected range.
- Tables and chart points drill through to source records. Export the currently visible filtered set and report success or failure.
- On-page definitions: completion rate = completed ÷ (total − cancelled); hours = SUM(`TimeEntry.hours`). No hard-coded datasets.
- Do not chart historical completion from current status. Need `completedAt` or status history first. `submittedAt` is not a completion timestamp.
- Charts stay inside the component (`STAT_GRID`, scrollable tabs). Grid lines use CSS variables in `app/globals.css`.
- Out: new chart families without a requirement, predictive analytics, utilization without a calendar, unvalidated financials, a separate reporting service.
